# @needs player
LOG Player PlayTest CI ResetState restores all fields
TIMESCALE 10
INVOKE /GridPlayer GridPlayer ResetState
SET /GridPlayer GridPlayer MoveSpeed 50
INVOKE /GridPlayer GridPlayer Move north
WAIT_UNTIL /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|IsMoving == False TIMEOUT 3
INVOKE /GridPlayer GridPlayer Move east
WAIT_UNTIL /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|IsMoving == False TIMEOUT 3
INVOKE /GridPlayer GridPlayer ResetState
ASSERT /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|PosX == 0
ASSERT /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|PosZ == 0
ASSERT /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|Score == 0
ASSERT /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|MoveCount == 0
ASSERT /GridPlayer|GridPlayer|IsMoving == False
TIMESCALE 1
ASSERT_CONSOLE_CLEAN
